Package: osr-updater
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: OSRBOT <winter@osrbot.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libxext6, libxft2, libxrender1
Homepage: https://github.com/osrbot/osr_updater
License: GPL-2.0-or-later
Description: Native ESP32-S3 firmware updater for OSRBOT vehicle controllers
 OSR Updater installs firmware files supplied by OSRBOT, preserves vehicle
 settings during supported updates, and provides a guarded recovery workflow.
